 src/tools/skill/{ => zauc-mocks-skill-tools}/tools.test.ts | 6 +++---
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 rename src/mcp/{ => zauc-mocks-mcp-index}/index.test.ts (100%)
 rename src/tools/skill/{ => zauc-mocks-skill-tools}/tools.test.ts (99%)

